  "blurb": "A five-bedroom, five-bathroom villa set high on Chaweng Hill, the last house on its road, with a panoramic east-facing sea view that cannot be built out. Sunrise reaches the bedrooms, the living room and the infinity pool, and a private elevator links every level. Completed in 2018 and sold fully furnished on a freehold Chanote title — 492 m² built on a 597 m² plot. Was ฿24,900,000. Now ฿22,000,000.",
  "detail": "Chaweng Hill rises directly behind Koh Samui's liveliest stretch of coast, and this villa sits near its crest — the final house on a quiet lane, with nothing beside it and nothing below to interrupt the view. The outlook runs east across the treetops and the bay to the open Gulf, so the day begins with sunrise over the water, seen from the bedrooms, the living room and the pool alike.\n\nThe main living level is open-plan and lined with full-height glass, leading out to a wide terrace, a covered outdoor dining table and an infinity-edge pool set against the panorama. A second pool terrace and a rooftop deck with shaded pavilion give further places to sit out, and the elevation brings a steady natural breeze. Inside, a fully fitted kitchen with island seating sits alongside the lounge, and a private elevator connects every floor.\n\nAll five bedrooms are en-suite, finished in a bright, contemporary palette with generous windows — several framing the sea directly from the bed. The villa was completed in 2018 and is offered fully furnished and ready to live in, equally suited to a private island home or a rental investment.\n\nThe land is 597 m² with 492 m² of built area, held freehold on a Chanote title. As with most premium view sites on Chaweng Hill, the access road is steep. Chaweng Beach, restaurants, international schools and Central Festival are all a few minutes' drive away.",
